For the aforesaid reasons, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award passed by the Senior Civil Judge and JMFC, Holalkere (for short 'the tribunal') in MVC.No.562/2017 dated 16.05.2019 is modified.
iii) The claimant is entitled for total compensation of Rs.3,03,773/- as against Rs.1,45,133/- awarded by the tribunal;
Devaraj K S vs Marulasiddeshwara R J on 31 March, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/107752679/
6 iv) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal is not disturbed and is left intact;
v) The insurer shall pay the enhanced compensation amount with interest @ 6% before the tribunal within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment.
Sd/-
